proval, NOT engineering approval, NOT qualification. No evaluator expectations were used to correct metadata.","reviewer":"Softwarefixture NOT humanapproval","revision_id":"sha256-d0b8aee8afcac7bf9080985724886332c47686c2da8974d031c3b4cb7dd9e49c"},"review_state":"reviewed","revision":{"aliases":[],"ancestry":[],"effective_from":null,"effective_until":null,"evidence":[],"item_id":"item-234cd908251b53a14d0ae0ead654efb1","reason":"Source intake","scopes":[],"source_id":"original_domain","source_sha256":"5bdc39e19ca7e885234c391fe24e0ea2e9585af57be456948c2b1506bf8ac066","spans":[{"end":210,"start":189},{"end":211,"start":210},{"end":310,"start":211},{"end":411,"start":310},{"end":513,"start":411},{"end":546,"start":513},{"end":547,"start":546},{"end":648,"start":547},{"end":704,"start":648},{"end":705,"start":704},{"end":771,"start":705},{"end":772,"start":771}],"status":"active","text":"## The two questions\n\n**Likelihood** concerns the item itself: given what the inspection found, how likely is it to stop\nperforming its function in the near term. A hairline coating blister on a thick-walled vessel is low\nlikelihood even on a critical vessel. A bearing with a vibration trend that has not plateaued is high\nlikelihood even on a spare pump.\n\n**Impact** concerns what happens if it does fail. This depends mainly on what the equipment does and\nwhat sits behind it, not on the wording of the finding.\n\nThe common error is scoring by how severe the description sounds.\n\n"},"revision_id":"sha256-d0b8aee8afcac7bf9080985724886332c47686c2da8974d031c3b4cb7dd9e49c"},"item-2989e627b05c86bb856864b4ba320826":{"decision_reason":null,"review":{"reason":"Isolated software selector diagnostic over unchanged raw C0 output. NOT human content approval, NOT engineering approval, NOT qualification. No evaluator expectations were used to correct metadata.","reviewer":"Softwarefixture NOT humanapproval","revision_id":"sha256-ec26843a6e1a7b11c0e90cdad4e0bbee1288b3862b8985d7c2c093dbf3f15d34"}