er unchanged raw C0 output. NOT human content approval, NOT engineering approval, NOT qualification. No evaluator expectations were used to correct metadata.","reviewer":"Softwarefixture NOT humanapproval","revision_id":"sha256-69aba44a1b18710d2644ca0f1933d56d4b0712b060fc8cfabf415e23904895d3"},"review_state":"reviewed","revision":{"aliases":[],"ancestry":[],"effective_from":null,"effective_until":null,"evidence":[],"item_id":"item-c9869a6dc646924114c358a37461364b","reason":"Source intake","scopes":[],"source_id":"original_domain","source_sha256":"5bdc39e19ca7e885234c391fe24e0ea2e9585af57be456948c2b1506bf8ac066","spans":[{"end":2451,"start":2440},{"end":2452,"start":2451},{"end":2546,"start":2452},{"end":2643,"start":2546},{"end":2741,"start":2643},{"end":2757,"start":2741},{"end":2758,"start":2757},{"end":2774,"start":2758},{"end":2793,"start":2774},{"end":2813,"start":2793},{"end":2844,"start":2813},{"end":2861,"start":2844},{"end":2862,"start":2861},{"end":2964,"start":2862},{"end":3062,"start":2964},{"end":3159,"start":3062},{"end":3166,"start":3159},{"end":3167,"start":3166}],"status":"active","text":"## Urgency\n\nNot an average of likelihood and impact, and not the maximum, though the maximum is closer. A\nlow-likelihood, high-impact finding on an SCE still requires attention this week. A near-certain\nfailure of something inconsequential can wait for the next shutdown. Urgency expresses how soon a\nhuman must act.\n\n- 9–10: today\n- 7–8: this week\n- 5–6: this month\n- 3–4: next planned shutdown\n- 1–2: backlog\n\nTwo conditions override the derived value. Anything that leaves a protection layer impaired without a\nrecorded deviation is immediate, because the installation is out of compliance from the point the\nimpairment is known. The same applies to anything that reduces evacuation capacity below the POB\ncount.\n\n"},"revision_id":"sha256-69aba44a1b18710d2644ca0f1933d56d4b0712b060fc8cfabf415e23904895d3"},"item-e96006448e012b89e1e61aec969f5297":{"decision